{"id": "68769", "title": "重生之名门佳人", "author": "顾潇", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 27, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/68/68769.htm", "intro": "穿越不是问题，重生才会精彩。她，苏菲，出生名门，自小生活在家人的羽翼下，一次任性使她吃尽苦头......直到重生，她才恍然惊觉，以前的她究竟错过多少风景……\r\n苏菲：“既然上天给我一次重生的机会，那么以前诸多的遗憾一定要完成。”今生她不要再恣意妄为，只愿为了她所重视亲人，展开翱翔的羽翼…", "base": "files/article/html/68/68769", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "10545035.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "10545036.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "10545037.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "10545038.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "10545039.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "10545040.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-40", "file": "10545041.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-50", "file": "10545042.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-60", "file": "10545043.html", "available": false}, {"title": "61-68", "file": "10545044.html", "available": false}, {"title": "69-77", "file": "10545045.html", "available": false}, {"title": "78-87", "file": "10545046.html", "available": false}, {"title": "88-97", "file": "10545047.html", "available": false}, {"title": "98-105", "file": "10545048.html", "available": false}, {"title": "106-113", "file": "10545049.html", "available": false}, {"title": "114-121", "file": "10545050.html", "available": false}, {"title": "122-129", "file": "10545051.html", "available": false}, {"title": "130-137", "file": "10545052.html", "available": false}, {"title": "138-145", "file": "10545053.html", "available": false}, {"title": "146-153", "file": "10545054.html", "available": false}, {"title": "154-161", "file": "10545055.html", "available": false}, {"title": "162-170", "file": "10545056.html", "available": false}, {"title": "171-178", "file": "10545057.html", "available": false}, {"title": "179-187", "file": "10545058.html", "available": false}, {"title": "188-195", "file": "10545